Fri Oct 23 15:42:00 UTC 2026 - Kris <kris@myslowrollos.org>

- Feature update for mySlowrollOS Control Center 1.0.0:
  * Added on-demand Privacy and Isolation mode (privacy.sh v3.0.1).
  * Added hardware/software microphone toggle utility (mic.sh).
  * Integrated Bluetooth monitoring and rfkill state handling.
  * Added 4th IP/DNS network profile with DoH notation support.
  * Integrated real-time atomic-update status monitoring.
  * Updated PolKit policy for system-level journalctl vacuuming.
  * Cleaned up rpmlintrc and hardened asynchronous process management.
  * Aligned Kirigami action buttons and symmetrical UI columns.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 19 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Kris <kris@myslowrollos.org>

- Initial package release 1.0.0 for openSUSE Slowroll / mySlowrollOS:
  * Centralized operational control center in C++20 / Qt 6 / Kirigami 6.
  * Real-time monitoring of CPU, RAM, thermal and disk usage.
  * Native PolKit policy integration for atomic-update, efibootmgr and zypper.
  * Fast UEFI firmware reboot and BootNext configuration.
  * Safe user custom actions and network profile switcher (IPv4/DNS).
  * AppStream metadata (org.myslowrollos.controlcenter.metainfo.xml).
